msgstr ""
"Erase all clipboard history, including favorites? This cannot be undone."

#: tabs/historico.c:324
msgid ""
"kistory (atividade: janelas, foco, arquivos, audio) e kimemory (area de "
"transferencia) guardam tudo em texto, sem capturas de tela. Ligar/desligar "
"os daemons fica na aba Iniciar automaticamente."
msgstr ""
"kistory (activity: windows, focus, files, audio) and kimemory (clipboard) "
"keep everything in text, with no screenshots. Turning the daemons on/off is "
"in the Autostart tab."

